<!-- ══════════ USE CASES ══════════ -->
<section class="sec" id="use-cases" aria-labelledby="h-uc">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead shead--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" data-rise>What will you verify?</span>
        <h2 class="display" id="h-uc" data-rise data-delay="1">One platform.<br>Many verifications.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede" data-rise data-delay="2">Same engine, configured to your need &mdash; whatever
        has to be witnessed, captured and proven.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="g g--3">
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="1">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 19.2v-1.6a5.2 5.2 0 0 1 5.2-5.2h5.6a5.2 5.2 0 0 1 5.2 5.2v1.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="7.2" r="3.7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Customer vKYC · V-CIP</h3>
        <p>Onboard a person on a live, RBI-compliant video call — identity, liveness and documents in one session.</p>
        <div class="capt"><b>Captures</b> · selfie · liveness · documents · location</div>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="2">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.4 10.2 12 3.6l8.6 6.6M5.6 11.9V20.4h12.8V11.9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M10 20.4v-4.6h4v4.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Property &amp; field verification</h3>
        <p>Geo-tagged, tamper-proof property evidence for mortgage and LAP. The agent&rsquo;s visit, proven.</p>
        <div class="capt"><b>Captures</b> · site photos · address plate · walkthrough · geo + time</div>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="3">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20.4V7.6L11 4.2v16.2M11 20.4h9V10.2L11 6.9M14 11.4h3M14 14.4h3M14 17.4h3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Business · corporate KYC &amp; Video PD</h3>
        <p>Verify the entity and the people behind it — registry, premises and signatories on one call.</p>
        <div class="capt"><b>Captures</b> · MCA · GST · premises · signatories</div>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="1">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 15.6h16M6.4 15.6v2.6M17.6 15.6v2.6M5.2 15.6 6.8 10.5A2.1 2.1 0 0 1 8.8 9h6.4a2.1 2.1 0 0 1 2 1.5l1.6 5.1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="8" cy="13" r="0.9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="16" cy="13" r="0.9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Collateral &amp; asset inspection</h3>
        <p>Auto, gold, machinery — capture-bound and geo-locked, never a reused photo.</p>
        <div class="capt"><b>Captures</b> · asset photos · serial / ID · condition · location</div>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="2">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3.4 4.8 6.4v5.3c0 4.4 3 8 7.2 9.3 4.2-1.3 7.2-4.9 7.2-9.3V6.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 12.3l2.2 2.2 4-4.3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Insurance claim inspection</h3>
        <p>Geo-tagged damage capture with reviewer sign-off — fraud-resistant by design.</p>
        <div class="capt"><b>Captures</b> · damage photos / video · geo + time · checklist</div>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="3">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="uc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="M12 7.2V12l3.2 1.9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 3.6v1.4M20.4 12H19M12 20.4V19M3.6 12H5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Periodic re-verification</h3>
        <p>Scheduled re-KYC or re-inspection — the same flow, on a cadence, fully audited.</p>
        <div class="capt"><b>Captures</b> · whatever the original flow did · on schedule</div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="card card--lg" style="margin-top:var(--s5);flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:var(--s5);align-items:center;justify-content:space-between" data-rise>
      <div style="max-width:34rem">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Don&rsquo;t see yours?</h3>
        <p style="margin-top:.5rem">If it needs a human-witnessed, tamper-proof, geo-bound check
          &mdash; you configure it. No new build, no new integration.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#demo">Talk it through <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════ LIFECYCLE DIAGRAM ══════════ -->
<section class="sec sec--warm" id="lifecycle" aria-labelledby="h-life">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead shead--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" data-rise>The lifecycle</span>
        <h2 class="display" id="h-life" data-rise data-delay="1">One call out.<br>One signed answer back.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede" data-rise data-delay="2">Everything between the request and the decision is
        Jaano&rsquo;s problem &mdash; capture, signals, review, evidence and audit.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dgm-wrap" style="margin-top:var(--s12)" data-rise>
      <div class="dgm-wrap__cap">
        <span class="tiny">Verification lifecycle</span>
        <span class="prow"><span class="pill pill--lav">Advisory AI</span>
          <span class="pill pill--gr">100% human decision</span></span>
      </div>
      <svg class="dgm draw" viewBox="0 0 1080 300" role="img" aria-label="The verification lifecycle: your system requests a URL; Jaano captures live, geo-locked evidence; AI surfaces advisory signals; a human reviews every case; a signed decision returns with the full audit trail.">
<defs><marker id="ah" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6.5" markerHeight="6.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#cbd5e1"/></marker></defs>
<path class="wire" d="M219.2 86 H239.2" marker-end="url(#ah)" data-d="1"/>
<circle class="flow travel" r="3.4" style="--p:path('M219.2 86 H239.2');--dur:2.4s;--dly:0.00s"/>
<path class="wire" d="M424.4 86 H444.4" marker-end="url(#ah)" data-d="2"/>
<circle class="flow travel" r="3.4" style="--p:path('M424.4 86 H444.4');--dur:2.4s;--dly:0.42s"/>
<path class="wire" d="M629.6 86 H649.6" marker-end="url(#ah)" data-d="3"/>
<circle class="flow travel" r="3.4" style="--p:path('M629.6 86 H649.6');--dur:2.4s;--dly:0.84s"/>
<path class="wire" d="M834.8 86 H854.8" marker-end="url(#ah)" data-d="4"/>
<circle class="flow travel" r="3.4" style="--p:path('M834.8 86 H854.8');--dur:2.4s;--dly:1.26s"/>
<path class="wire wire--live" d="M540.0 132 V166 H334.8 V138.0" marker-end="url(#ah)" data-d="5"/>
<text class="sub" x="437.4" y="184" text-anchor="middle">unusable capture is re-taken — the journey never dead-ends</text>
<path class="wire" d="M950.4 132 V228 H129.6 V138.0" marker-end="url(#ah)" data-d="6"/>
<circle class="flow flow--el travel" r="3.4" style="--p:path('M950.4 132 V228 H129.6 V138.0');--dur:4s;--dly:2.2s"/>
<text class="sub" x="540" y="246" text-anchor="middle">one signed webhook back — decision, evidence and hash-chained audit trail</text>
<rect class="node node--el" x="40.0" y="40" width="179.2" height="92" rx="13"/>
<g transform="translate(56.0,56)"><rect class="ic ic--el" x="0" y="1" width="20" height="13" rx="3"/><path class="ic ic--el" d="M5 18h10M10 14v4"/></g>
<text x="56.0" y="96">Step 01</text>
<text class="lbl" x="56.0" y="112">Your system</text>
<text class="sub" x="56.0" y="126">POST /v1/cases/issue-url</text>
<rect class="node node--lav" x="245.2" y="40" width="179.2" height="92" rx="13"/>
<g transform="translate(261.2,56)"><rect class="ic" x="0" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="3.5"/><circle class="ic" cx="10" cy="10" r="3.8"/></g>
<text x="261.2" y="96">Step 02</text>
<text class="lbl" x="261.2" y="112">Live capture</text>
<text class="sub" x="261.2" y="126">camera-bound, geo + time</text>
<rect class="node node--el" x="450.4" y="40" width="179.2" height="92" rx="13"/>
<g transform="translate(466.4,56)"><path class="ic ic--el" d="M0 16 L5.5 7 L11 12 L16 2"/><path class="ic ic--el" d="M0 19h20"/></g>
<text x="466.4" y="96">Step 03</text>
<text class="lbl" x="466.4" y="112">AI signals</text>
<text class="sub" x="466.4" y="126">OCR · face · liveness scores</text>
<rect class="node node--gr" x="655.6" y="40" width="179.2" height="92" rx="13"/>
<g transform="translate(671.6,56)"><circle class="ic ic--gr" cx="10" cy="5.5" r="4.2"/><path class="ic ic--gr" d="M2 19v-1.6A7.4 7.4 0 0 1 9.4 10h1.2a7.4 7.4 0 0 1 7.4 7.4V19"/></g>
<text x="671.6" y="96">Step 04</text>
<text class="lbl" x="671.6" y="112">Human review</text>
<text class="sub" x="671.6" y="126">maker–checker, 100% of cases</text>
<rect class="node node--lav" x="860.8" y="40" width="179.2" height="92" rx="13"/>
<g transform="translate(876.8,56)"><path class="ic" d="M10 1 2.6 4.2v5.1c0 4.5 3 8.2 7.4 9.7 4.4-1.5 7.4-5.2 7.4-9.7V4.2Z"/><path class="ic" d="M6.6 10.2 9 12.6l4.4-4.6"/></g>
<text x="876.8" y="96">Step 05</text>
<text class="lbl" x="876.8" y="112">Signed decision</text>
