</svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════ ENGINE ══════════ -->
<section class="sec sec--ink" id="engine" aria-labelledby="h-eng">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="blob" style="width:35rem;height:35rem;bottom:-16rem;left:-10rem;
    background:rgba(124,58,237,.32)"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead shead--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" data-rise>One engine &middot; any verification</span>
        <h2 class="display" id="h-eng" data-rise data-delay="1">The capabilities every<br>verification shares.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede" data-rise data-delay="2">Configure once. The same compliant engine powers every
        use case above.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="g g--3">
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="1">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="num">01</span>
        <h3>Configurable checklist &amp; questions</h3>
        <p>Define exactly what to capture and ask — per use case, per product. The wedge incumbents don&rsquo;t expose.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="2">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="num">02</span>
        <h3>Live, capture-bound evidence</h3>
        <p>Photos and video come from the live camera — never a gallery upload. No reused or borrowed images.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="3">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="num">03</span>
        <h3>Liveness · geo · timestamp</h3>
        <p>Every artefact bound to a real moment and place. Liveness for people; geo and time-lock for assets and sites.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="1">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="num">04</span>
        <h3>OCR + AI signals</h3>
        <p>Self-hosted OCR and face/liveness models surface raw scores — advisory, never a black-box pass/fail.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="2">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="num">05</span>
        <h3>Maker–checker · 100%</h3>
        <p>Every case independently reviewed, anti-collusion enforced. No sampling — stricter than the RBI minimum.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="3">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="num">06</span>
        <h3>Tamper-evident audit + one API</h3>
        <p>Hash-chained logs, retention built in. One REST call in, one signed webhook out — multi-tenant from day one.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════ CAPTURE MODES ══════════ -->
<section class="sec" id="how" aria-labelledby="h-how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead shead--split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" data-rise>How it&rsquo;s captured</span>
        <h2 class="display" id="h-how" data-rise data-delay="1">Agent-led, self-serve,<br>or in the field.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede" data-rise data-delay="2">Pick the capture mode per use case &mdash; the engine,
        signals and audit trail stay the same.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="g g--3">
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="1">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="num">Mode · 01</span>
        <h3>Agent-led video</h3>
        <p>A live officer runs the session — V-CIP, video PD, remote inspection. Maker–checker on every case.</p>
        <div class="capt">Best for regulated identity and underwriting conversations.</div>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="2">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="num">Mode · 02</span>
        <h3>On-site field</h3>
        <p>Your agent captures on location — property, collateral, claim. Geo and time-locked, reviewed back at base.</p>
        <div class="capt">Best for anything that must be witnessed in place.</div>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--lg" data-rise data-delay="3">
        <span class="card__bar"></span>
        <span class="num">Mode · 03</span>
        <h3>Self-serve</h3>
        <p>The customer completes a guided flow alone — same signals, same audit, no agent in the loop.</p>
        <div class="capt">Best for volume, and for reaching beyond agent hours.</div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="dgm-wrap" style="margin-top:var(--s5)" data-rise>
      <div class="dgm-wrap__cap">
        <span class="tiny">Coverage &middot; use case &times; capture mode</span>
        <span class="prow"><span class="pill"><span class="ck">&check;</span> Supported</span>
          <span class="pill pill--lav">&#9679; Guided self-serve</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="mx"><table>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col" style="text-align:left">Use case</th>
          <th scope="col">Agent-led video</th><th scope="col">On-site field</th>
          <th scope="col">Self-serve</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">Customer vKYC &middot; V-CIP</th>
            <td><span class="y">&check;</span></td><td><span class="n">&mdash;</span></td>
            <td><span class="y">&check;</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Property &amp; field verification</th>
            <td><span class="y">&check;</span></td><td><span class="y">&check;</span></td>
            <td><span class="n">&mdash;</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Business &middot; corporate KYC &amp; PD</th>
            <td><span class="y">&check;</span></td><td><span class="y">&check;</span></td>
            <td><span class="n">&mdash;</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Collateral &amp; asset inspection</th>
            <td><span class="y">&check;</span></td><td><span class="y">&check;</span></td>
            <td><span class="n">&mdash;</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Insurance claim inspection</th>
            <td><span class="y">&check;</span></td><td><span class="y">&check;</span></td>
            <td><span class="p">&#9679;</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Periodic re-verification</th>
            <td><span class="y">&check;</span></td><td><span class="y">&check;</span></td>
            <td><span class="y">&check;</span></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
